# OrbitGuard | ASTRA 2026 | Team AstroNex
# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Restart `python app.py` after editing.
# Free NASA key: https://api.nasa.gov  (DEMO_KEY allows only ~30 requests/hour)
NASA_API_KEY=
# Google Photorealistic 3D for Earth View: Google Cloud > enable 'Maps JavaScript API' > Credentials > API key.
# Needs billing enabled (5,000 free 3D map loads/month). Restrict the key to http://127.0.0.1:5000/* and your deploy URL.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
